Package: nekoproxy
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: 秋山羽咲 <neko.dev1@outlook.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libgssapi-krb5-2, libsecret-1-0, dbus-user-session, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libgl1, libegl1, xdg-utils
Recommends: gnome-keyring | keepassxc, xdg-desktop-portal, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0
Description: Graphical server and network protocol deployment manager
 Self-contained Avalonia desktop application. Run the GUI as a normal user.
 Credentials require an unlocked Secret Service keyring in the desktop session;
 this package never falls back to plaintext storage.
 Removing this package does not remove files from user home directories.
